WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:19.675
The queen scratched her arms.

2
00:00:19.675 --> 00:00:24.138
"We cleaned the whole castle!" she moaned.

3
00:00:24.139 --> 00:00:27.509
"The fleas are still here."

4
00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:31.523
"I'm itchy!" the king cried.

5
00:00:31.523 --> 00:00:35.206
A rat ran into the Throne Room.

6
00:00:35.206 --> 00:00:39.966
"Eek! Now we have rats!" Princess Mary cried.

7
00:00:39.966 --> 00:00:43.801
"Do something, Wizard!" the king yelled.

8
00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:46.989
More rats ran in.

9
00:00:46.989 --> 00:00:50.223
Cat jumped out of Tom's pocket.

10
00:00:50.223 --> 00:00:52.418
Tom waved his wand.

11
00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:55.603
"Scat, rats!" Tom cried.

12
00:00:55.603 --> 00:00:58.579
The rats saw the cat.

13
00:00:58.579 --> 00:01:01.249
They ran out.

14
00:01:01.249 --> 00:01:06.364
"Good job, Wizard!" the king said.

15
00:01:06.364 --> 00:01:10.104
"Where did the rats come from?" Tom asked.

16
00:01:10.104 --> 00:01:14.789
"Rats like dirty dungeons," Cat whispered.

17
00:01:14.789 --> 00:01:18.133
"And fleas like rats!"

18
00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:20.324
Tom looked at Dirk.

19
00:01:20.324 --> 00:01:23.980
"Fleas like rats," he said.

20
00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:27.036
"Did you clean the Grim Dungeon?"

21
00:01:27.036 --> 00:01:31.326
"No one cleans dungeons!" Dirk snapped.

22
00:01:31.326 --> 00:01:33.446
The queen frowned.

23
00:01:33.446 --> 00:01:37.086
"This is your fault, Dirk!" she said.

24
00:01:37.086 --> 00:01:41.591
"Clean that dirty dungeon at once!"

25
00:01:41.591 --> 00:01:46.430
"Servants!" Dirk yelled. "Clean the dungeon!"

26
00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:52.719
"I told you to clean it," said the queen.

27
00:01:52.719 --> 00:02:03.477
Dirk stomped out of the Throne Room.

28
00:02:03.477 --> 00:02:08.086
He went to clean the Grim Dungeon.

29
00:02:08.086 --> 00:02:10.518
The king turned to Tom.

30
00:02:10.518 --> 00:02:17.359
"Now make these fleas go away!" he said.

31
00:02:17.359 --> 00:02:20.099
Tom waved his wand.

32
00:02:20.099 --> 00:02:25.959
"Fleas, flee!" he cried. "Be gone!"

33
00:02:25.959 --> 00:02:30.237
The fleas turned to bees!

34
00:02:30.237 --> 00:02:33.270
They flew around the room.

35
00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:36.486
“Run!” the king cried.

36
00:02:36.486 --> 00:02:44.452
"Oops," Tom said.
